From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Branson <andrew.branson@jolla.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Apr 2026 14:12:25 +0200
Subject: [sailfishos][embedlite] Present offscreen WebRender frames

Track safe-area-inset usage so EmbedLite callers can distinguish pages that
intentionally draw into the cutout area.

Restore a dedicated EGLImage-backed offscreen target for EmbedLite while
leaving ordinary offscreen contexts on the standard framebuffer path. ESR153
distinguishes rendering from presenting, so run the presentation path for
EmbedLite frames in order to publish the completed offscreen image.
